WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.230
Morning, Tsuyopon!

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.320
Let me see your homework!

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.150
You're out of luck.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:16.500
Get in line.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.530
You guys only show up early at times like this!

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.410
It's why you showed up early too...

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.250
The early bird gets the notes.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.140
Come on! Just finish copying already!

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.040
Don't rush us.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.150
Summer break has ended
and the second term begun.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:03.800
As usual he'll be socializing
with those around him.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.200
"Those around"?!

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.680
But he's glad that today, he'll also
be able to see the girl he likes.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.520
"The girl he likes"?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.190
Oh...

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.440
That must be Kobayakawa-san!

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:15.620
Mm-hm.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:19.010
During summer break, he was only
able to see her at the beach,

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:21.440
so young Hashiba,
while not a great student,

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.860
has still been waiting eagerly
for school to start again!

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.890
Well, I would like to see
more progress in your relationship.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.450
Just kiss her already.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.160
Break her in!

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:35.000
Shut up, you guys!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.740
We're just supporting you!

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:38.540
In what way?!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:40.340
Hashiba-kun, come with me.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.510
Huh...?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.260
You copied the homework

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.320
from someone else, didn't you?

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:48.180
The answers are all off by one row.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.900
Um, uh...

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:50.890
You're out.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.600
Redo this and turn it in
by the end of the day.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.710
Sorry to trouble you.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.230
Ugh! This happened because
those two were so slow!

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.990
Kobayakawa-san.

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.150
Hashiba-kun.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:07.490
Kobayakawa-san, are you here
to see Katakura-sensei, too?

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.200
Yeah.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.080
I'm turning in our homework papers.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.290
Eh, that reminds me,

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.330
I have something to give you.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.820
Photos from our visit to the beach.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.840
They're from Yukirin.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.260
Oh, Yukirin made extra copies for us!

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.650
Yeah. They're very nice photos, too.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.930
Especially this group one.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.650
From just before we headed back?

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.780
I liked it a lot, so I put it up on my wall.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.480
You did?

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.570
I might do the same thing with my copy, then.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.440
Yeah.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.490
That's a great idea.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.220
There you are!

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.460
Kobayakawa-san!

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:55.110
I'm also on class duty today,

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.630
so I chased you here.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.830
Mochizuki-kun?

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:00.960
Let me know if there's anything
else that needs to be done.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.990
I'll help out.

00:04:01.990 --> 00:04:02.500
Sure.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.300
Mocchi?

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.410
Huh?! Mocchi?!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.040
You're in Class 5?!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.470
And you cut your hair?!

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:11.010
That's right.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.670
Thanks again for your help
with the tennis thing.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:15.350
You were really good.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.310
A friend?

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:20.160
Yeah, since Kei-chan's always hanging
around with the basketball team.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.860
Hashiba-kun, I had no idea you and
Kobayakawa-san also knew each other.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:28.350
We've been getting along well ourselves,
now that we sit next to each other.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.720
Kobayakawa-san is a great student.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:33.860
I'm not, really...

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.700
Your notes are also very neat.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.910
You have good handwriting.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.330
What?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.400
Oh, wanna read this?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:45.260
No way.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:49.810
I was just wondering why I had
to get you sitting next to me

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.970
Hey, that's rude!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:55.690
It's because the four of us got packed
into this corner when we drew seats.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.680
Yeah, but...

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.790
You see, Mocchi...

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.940
He said he sits next to Kobayakawa-san.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.940
I'm just jealous that he's in
the same class and gets to do that.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.960
Before you complain. remember that Yukirin
and I go to totally different schools.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.410
O-Oh, right.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.620
Sorry.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.400
It's fine. I don't really care.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.570
Why not follow Mattsun's example?

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:17.500
His example?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.460
The way he'll go off to other classrooms
during breaks, with no real purpose.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.400
Nah, I felt a good vibe between us!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.350
I think things will be fine as they are!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.180
Yeah!

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.380
You do?

00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:33.180
Well, I'm heading back to class.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.180
Mattsun, what did you even come here for?

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.300
To shoot the breeze.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.600
What's with that?

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.120
Crap...

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.430
She wasn't there.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:45.320
Found her.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:47.070
Grr...

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.670
Kobayakawa-san,

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:50.990
I'm amazed you solved that problem.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.790
That's Mocchi.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:55.990
Spitting Woman!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.560
You again? Buzz off!

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.120
Mind if I ask something?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.870
Are Mocchi and—

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:05.420
That hurt!

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.420
Anna's gone!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.010
Anna! Wait for me!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.600
Did you get in a fight?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.400
Yeah, with a cat-type female soldier.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.530
Tsutsui-san?

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.850
So Kobayakawa-san was there too?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:26.720
She was, yeah. Along with Mocchi...

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.550
Yeah, he mentioned they
sit next to each other.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.610
That's all?

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.780
Yeah. Why?

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.300
Well...

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:38.370
Spitting Woman was openly
hostile to Mocchi, so I thought...

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.290
...Mocchi must like Kobayakawa-san!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.210
Or maybe not.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.090
It just crossed my mind.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:51.420
Mocchi was blushing, though.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.100
That was awful. I messed up.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.000
Nah, it was a good play.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:06:59.890
You serious?

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:00.550
Oh.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:01.480
Hey!

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.310
Here he is!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.350
Sorry for the wait.

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.580
You're late!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.060
What were you doing?

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:09.270
I was talking to a girl for a bit.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:10.360
A girl?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.260
Yeah.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.910
She told me to do my best with the team.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.140
Now I'm even more motivated than usual.

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:17.750
Good for you.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.990
Is she in your class?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:20.240
Yes.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:24.290
She sits next to me.
Her name is Kobayakawa-san.

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.710
You're in love, huh? I'm jealous.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.030
Nah...

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:32.180
What was that?!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.940
You two were talking the entire time during class!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:38.090
He talked to me, so I responded...

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:41.810
You shouldn't do that, Anna! You're cute!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.480
Oh, Kobayakawa-san.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.240
I told you, you can't do that!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.290
But he waved.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.330
You can't!

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.240
You're too cute!

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.970
Mocchi's the basketball team's ace.

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:02.700
He's a passionate one,
though you'd never guess it.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.630
Whoa, he's pretty bold.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:10.840
I'm impressed.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:11.820
Hold on!

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:13.670
Isn't it unfair for him to eat with her?

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.970
If you think it's unfair,
then go join them.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.870
There's a seat open next to the Spitting Woman.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.220
I-I'd like to go, but...

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.040
I could lend you my whip.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:23.680
I'll pass!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.920
Na-chan.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.840
You need to put in at least this much effort.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.060
Are you okay with just watching
him take her away from you?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.660
Mind if I sit here?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.020
Huh? There's no way I'd let you.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:48.580
Don't let that stand in your way.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.000
Hashiba-kun.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.350
Go ahead.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:55.170
Kobayakawa-san.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.670
I see.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.310
You really are nice, Kobayakawa-san.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.230
Am I?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.770
Yes! That was very considerate!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.710
You saw how much Hashiba-kun
wanted to sit next to Tsutsui-san.

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:18.260
I think it's lovely how considerate
you are of those around you.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.840
Hold on, Mocchi.

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:23.990
That's not it. Listen...

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:25.720
Oh, don't be silly.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.420
There's no need to be embarrassed.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.160
Right?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.000
Mocchi...

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.210
What is it?

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:34.380
Oh, I know.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:35.980
Are you free this weekend?

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:38.350
We're having a match,
so come watch if you'd like.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:41.630
Kobayakawa-san!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:47.020
Can we talk elsewhere for a moment?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:50.140
Sure.

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:56.700
I wonder what got into Na-chan.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.720
Is he finally confessing?

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.240
Not bad.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.090
Um, you wanted to talk?

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.060
Um...

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.850
May I ask you something?

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.750
When he said you wanted to sit
next to Mari-chan, was that true?

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.090
No, it wasn't!

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:21.790
That was a misunderstanding on his part.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:22.930
Was it?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:23.590
Yeah.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.510
I see.

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:31.850
The truth is,

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.270
I'd rather have sat next to you!

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.190
Then...

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.150
...let's eat lunch together tomorrow.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:46.490
C-Can we?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:46.990
Sure.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.870
Mari-chan will be there, too.
Let's all eat together.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:51.930
Huh?

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.990
I always have lunch with Mari-chan.

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:56.670
So, I'd like Matsunaga-kun and
your other friends to join us, too.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.280
Oh, and I'd love for
Yukirin to join us, as well,

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.590
but she's at another school,
so I guess she can't.

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.060
What do you think?

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.510
Wouldn't it be fun?

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.230
Yeah. That sounds great.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.350
As his rival, Mocchi...

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.700
You're busy with the team.

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.190
Do you have time for a girlfriend?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.110
When would you go on dates?

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.440
From what guys with girlfriends tell me,

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.030
it'll work out somehow.

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:28.200
Can we go back to the classroom now?

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.380
I'm tired.
